; OLGame.exe imports exactly one function from DINPUT8.dll - DirectInput8Create, by
; name. The system DLL also exports DllCanUnloadNow, DllGetClassObject,
; DllRegisterServer and DllUnregisterServer; none of them is imported by the game or
; reachable through this copy, because nothing in the process asks this module for a
; COM class factory. Exporting stubs for them would add four forwarders that can only
; ever be called by something that found this file by name, which is not a caller worth
; standing up.
LIBRARY dinput8
EXPORTS
    DirectInput8Create
